    <bpmn:process id="W_W1358" name="W1358. Seasonal Workforce Scaling, Temporary Hiring Ramp &amp; Post-Season Right-Sizing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Seasonal demand forecast indicating &gt; 20% sales uplift during a defined period (e.g., Q4 ber-months Oct–Dec, summer Mar–May, back-to-school May–Jun)
Frequency: 3 major seasonal ramps per year; each lasting 2–3 months
Volume: ~10–15% temporary workforce increase = ~670–1,000 seasonal workers across 200 stores and 4 DCs; primarily Sales Associates (stores) and Pickers/Packers (DCs)
Owner: HR Manager
Participants: HR Manager, Store Manager (demand estimate), DC Operations Manager (DC demand), Recruitment Specialist, Training Coordinator, Payroll Specialist
Source: workflow W1358 — Seasonal Workforce Scaling, Temporary Hiring Ramp &amp; Post-Season Right-Sizing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1358_LaneSet7">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1358_Lane1" name="Supply Planning Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1358_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1358_Start8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
